judge_prompts.json.portable_text:
[
  {
    "judge": 1,
    "message": "Act as an independent prose reviewer in a bounded writing pilot. Read ONLY <EVAL_ROOT>/review_packet_1.json. Do not browse, read other files, parent history, published abstracts, guides, protocols, notes or mappings, or infer condition identities. The packet supplies body sources and eight anonymous A/B pairs. For each pair assess factual fidelity (pass, concern, fail with a located reason), and four 1-5 ordinal dimensions: contribution clarity, argument connection (does a specific relationship explain the design or what the evidence establishes), evidence selection (with consequential conditions intact), and language including explanatory economy. A 1 is a serious deficiency, 3 adequate but limited, and 5 precise, specific and compelling for this unit; grammatical accuracy alone is not excellence. Give preferred A, B or Tie and a decisive located reason, not a preference for order, length, caution, more numbers or familiarity. Allow defensible ties without expecting a direction. If a major relation is missing or obscured, identify it specifically; do not invent defects. Fidelity defects take precedence over fluent prose. Do not require every table entry or every limitation. Return exactly JSON {\"reviews\":[{\"case\":\"P1\",\"sample\":1,\"unit\":\"abstract\",\"fidelity\":{\"A\":{\"status\":\"pass\",\"reason\":\"located reason\"},\"B\":{\"status\":\"pass\",\"reason\":\"located reason\"}},\"ratings\":{\"A\":{\"contribution\":3,\"argument\":3,\"selection\":3,\"language\":3},\"B\":{\"contribution\":3,\"argument\":3,\"selection\":3,\"language\":3}},\"preferred\":\"Tie\",\"reason\":\"decisive located comparison\"}]} for all eight pairs. Write one untouched judgment using apply_patch to <EVAL_ROOT>/raw/judge_1.json, without revisions after writing or repository changes. Final: path only."
